  "task_defect": {
    "status": "no",
    "reason": "The source conflict is resolvable: the registry expressly makes record-17 approved and in force and record-22 an unapproved draft. The request supplies enough information for an assembly-only gross-savings proposal while allowing capex and other missing inputs to remain unresolved. The historical policy assumptions can be used as given without external legal verification; they do not establish the broader eligibility assurance made in the deliverable."
  }
